spoiler":false,"text":"しかし、村が嫌いなわけでは無く、周囲と上手くやりたいという気持ちは持っている。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"1299","sourceWorkId":"24954","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"村の古いしきたりや閉鎖的な考えが嫌で、早く村を出たいと考えている女子校生。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"そのため外から村にやって来た雅也に対して、あまり良い印象を抱いていない。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"少しぶっきらぼうな性格だが、根は素直で可愛い部分もある。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"村を快く思ってないせいで孤立することが多いが、巫女の巴だけは自分を分かってくれる理解者だと思い、よく相談に乗ってもらっている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"サーフィンが好きで、放課後などは浜辺にいることが多い。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ただし将来サーファーになりたいとまでは思っておらず、あくまで趣味として楽しんでいる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「こんな村、とっとと出て行ってやる！」"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"47267"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/44/446bd8a70dcf4890e51d743756e158749936985ce69c3ec5cbae5c481f02d6cf.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/a2/a253fa7ec091417f13d66b944a217a41622adefccd8c2816f45f1d7ab6cc5b43.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"飯野ユウ","creatorId":"vndb:s931","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s931","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s931","name":"飯野 ユウ","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:80835:47267:6377:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c18638","characterName":"矢向 巴","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"47268","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"80835"}],"egsCharacterIds":["1300"],"vndbCharacterId":"c18638"},"originalCharacterName":"矢向 巴","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Miko from village's shrine who live alone without any relatives."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c18638"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"神に仕えるクールな巫女"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"・職業　　：巫女"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"村の神社で身寄りもなく一人で暮らす巫女。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"島村民たちの相談役のような事もしていて、頼りにされている存在。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"常に冷静沈着で、あまり感情を表に出さない。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"どこかしら達観しているところがある。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"誰とでも広く浅く接することが多いが麻希からは特に慕われていて、姉妹のような間柄になっている。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"1300","sourceWorkId":"18859","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"村の神社で、身寄りもなく一人で暮らす巫女。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"島村民たちの相談役のようなこともしていて、頼りにされている存在。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"常に冷静沈着で、あまり感情を表に出さない。 どこかしら達観しているところがある。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"誰とでも広く浅く接することが多いが、麻希からは特に慕われていて、姉妹のような間柄になっている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「私は神に仕える身ですから…… 悩みなんてありませんよ」"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"47268"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/4d/4d7a57695306e79963b42efa0ab06a1c81e258550c7c4c8d3333ee00c4278b5a.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/50/507470efd74e19c85790f3fe91d80ee8085b594a9ce3611af4e3f3ee1f709109.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"松山紗香","creatorId":"vndb:s904","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s904","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s904","name":"松山 紗香","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:80835:47268:10662:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c18639","characterName":"恩田 穂乃香","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"47269","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"80835"}],"egsCharacterIds":["1301"],"vndbCharacterId":"c18639"},"originalCharacterName":"恩田 穂乃香","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Female teacher who teaches children from the village. She loves children and dreams that give birth to her own and marries her boyfriend whom she met at university."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c18639"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"朗らかで少し夢見がちな女教師"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"・職業　　：教師"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"少ないながらも村にいる子供たちに勉強を教えている女教師。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"熱心で子供たちからも好かれている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"性格は朗らかだが、ちょっとしたことで落ち込みやすい。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"さらに酒に飲まれやすく、泣き上戸でしばしば人に迷惑をかけることも。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"看護師の祐未とは同年代で、彼女が村へ来て最初に友達になった。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"それもあって、昼休みに診療所へ来て一緒にお昼を食べることも多い。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"実は大学で知り合った彼氏がいる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"将来的に彼と結婚して子供を生み、平凡で幸せに暮らせたらと夢見ている。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"1301","sourceWorkId":"18859","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"少ないながらも村にいる子供たちに勉強を教えている女教師。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"熱心で、子供たちからも好かれている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"性格は朗らかだが、ちょっとしたことで落ち込みやすい。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"さらに酒に飲まれやすく、泣き上戸でしばしば人に迷惑をかけることも。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"看護師の祐未とは同年代で、彼女が村へ来て最初に友達になった。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"それもあって、昼休みに診療所へ来て一緒にお昼を食べることも多い。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"実は大学で知り合った彼氏がいる。 将来的に彼と結婚して子供を生み、平凡で幸せに暮らせたらと夢見ている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「あぁ、早く結婚して幸せな家庭を築きたいわ……」"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"47269"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/ac/aca272b1528d833c4a0ab31f04c3334ab5d80b5da2e0dd105981c10ed7eced62.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/62/62d9f6d018288c805d39b88e700f044364220163375a815f248e85f78ca1bccb.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"立石めぐみ","creatorId":"vndb:s646","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s646","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s646","name":"立石 めぐみ","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:80835:47269:10027:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c18640","characterName":"宮倉 由乃","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"47270","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"120319"},{"characterId":"47270","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"80835"}],"egsCharacterIds":["1302"],"vndbCharacterId":"c18640"},"originalCharacterName":"宮倉 由乃","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Masaya's aunt and sister of his deceased mother. Since Masaya came to the village, she helps him with everything as a maid."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"In \"Tegome ni Sareru Kyuunin no Otome\" she isn't the protagonist's aunt but only the housekeeper of the place he goes to live. She became the housekeeper to look for a chance to exact revenge against house she is serving, with the help of the protagonist"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c18640"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"何か秘密を隠している親類"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"・職業　　：女中"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"雅也が村にやってきてから、事細かに生活のサポートをしてくれる女中。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"屋敷も取り仕切っていて、鈴などの上役に当たる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"雅也の母親の妹で、雅也は甥に当たる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"とにかく村のことを第一に考え、当主である雅也の父の亡き後、陰に日なたに村を支えてきた人物。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"雅也を呼び寄せようと考えたのも彼女らしいのだが……。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"1302","sourceWorkId":"18859","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"雅人の実家に勤めている女中。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"雅人が家を追い出された後にやって来た。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"雅人を呼び寄せた張本人。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"雅人の復讐=自分の復讐でもあるので、事細かにサポートしてくれる。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"1302","sourceWorkId":"21033","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"雅人の実家に勤めている女中。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"雅人が家を追い出された後にやって来た。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"雅人を呼び寄せた張本人。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"雅人の復讐＝自分の復讐でもあるので、事細かにサポートしてくれる。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"1302","sourceWorkId":"24954","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"雅也が村にやって来てから、事細かに生活のサポートをしてくれる女中。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"屋敷を取り仕切っていて、鈴などの上役を務める。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"雅也の母親の妹で、雅也は彼女の甥に当たる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"とにかく村のことを第一に考え、当主である雅也の父の亡き後、陰に日なたに村を支えてきた人物。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"雅也を呼び寄せようと考えたのも彼女らしいのだが……。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「雅也さんにはできるだけ早くお嫁さんを決めてもらわないと……」"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"47270"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/88/8886a8a78bf485dc024654f048651f5c177e393b1bf38a7dbf651a64eef354b7.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/fd/fd583c874b3a6b3791fec9b9ba2dad03afa2315aea98a5dd540760bf14c491e7.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"水口まつり","creatorId":"vndb:s879","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s879","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s879","name":"水口 まつり","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:80835:47270:6380:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c20244","characterName":"久香 雅也","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"90084","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"80835"}],"egsCharacterIds":["1303"],"vndbCharacterId":"c20244"},"originalCharacterName":"久香 雅也","characterNameSource":null,"role":"main","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"A young man who was born without a father and raised just by his mother. His mother passed away at a time when he studied. He grew splendidly and gained the medical license without repetition."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c20244"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"誠実で真面目な医師"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"・職業　　：医師（研修医）"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"産まれた時から父親がおらず、母親１人に育てられた青年。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"その母親も、主人公が学生の頃に亡くなってしまう。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"それでも立派に育ち、留年無しで医師免許を取った。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"誠実で真面目な性格。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"まだ研修医ながら、優秀で腕は確かなうえ人当たりも良いため、患者からの人気・信頼度も高い。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"恋人のいた次期もあるが、現在は独り身。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"女性に対してはどちらかと言えば奥手な性分。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"1303","sourceWorkId":"18859","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"産まれた時から父親がおらず、母親ひとりに育てられた青年。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"その母親も、主人公が学生の頃に亡くなってしまう。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"それでも立派に育ち、留年無しで医師免許を取った。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"誠実でまじめな性格。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"まだ研修医ながら優秀で、腕は確かなうえ人当たりも良いため、患者からの人気・信頼度も高い。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"90084"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/18/18001f102b2225407d0ef8b8b17f867aedc540541c0633e3a9f0ac772f24da3c.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/7c/7c652c57f9a9357db0a1aa24409a819dec37dab7ba448b03dc51d9a918b0b305.webp","width":158,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]}],"songs":[],"companies":[{"companyId":"egs:brand:91","sourceCompanyId":"egs:brand:91","canonicalEntityId":"egs:brand:91","name":"Guilty","roleCodes":["brand"],"identityStatus":"ambiguous-shared-work-review","relationId":"egs:work-brand:36206:91","source":"egs"},{"companyId":"vndb:p15756","sourceCompanyId":"vndb:p15756","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:p15756","name":"SVN","roleCodes":["publisher"],"identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:release-producer:126820:v12443","source":"vndb"},{"companyId":"vndb:p100","sourceCompanyId":"vndb:p100","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:p100","name":"株式会社ウィルプラス","roleCodes":["publisher"],"identityStatus":"source-native","